WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.852
Materialized views still need a clear grain In this
example one

00:00:05.879 --> 00:00:11.533
row represents one diagnosis The measures summarize
admissions for

00:00:11.546 --> 00:00:17.228
that diagnosis The refreshed-at value records when
the stored result

00:00:17.254 --> 00:00:22.876
was produced Consumers need both the grain and
freshness information to

00:00:22.903 --> 00:00:24.482
interpret the data correctly
